    "plain_text": "John Albert Sobrato is an American property developer who built a Silicon Valley real estate fortune. He began selling homes while at Santa Clara University, then developed industrial buildings with his mother and business partners. His Sobrato Organization expanded into offices and apartments while remaining owned entirely by his family.",
